      "end": 44.939,
      "word_start": 83,
      "word_end": 105
    },
    {
      "text": "Knowledge compounds, but only when used. One useful idea applied repeatedly can alter an entire life. Become the person who keeps learning after everybody else has decided they already know enough.",
